<title>USA: May flows to US stock funds est. at $18.5 bln-ICI.</title>
<headline>May flows to US stock funds est. at $18.5 bln-ICI.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-06-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Estimated net flows to stock mutual funds were $18.5 billion in May, up from inflows of $15.7 billion in April, a trade group said Thursday.  </p>
<p>The Investment Company Institute said the estimated inflow to bond and income funds was $2.5 billion in May after net inflows of $800 million in April.</p>
<p>The monthly estimates are derived from unpublished weekly estimates based upon a survey of long-term funds that account for about 97 percent of long-term mutual fund assets, ICI said.</p>
</text>
